{"id": "EUVD-2026-96703", "enisaUuid": "94d6a45b-f089-3523-b68c-e25a3c4087d8", "description": "CordysCRM through 1.9.3 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the POST /custom-form/data/import endpoint that allows authenticated users to import data into any custom form by customFormId. Low-privileged attackers can upload Excel files with importType ADD or UPDATE to create records in, or overwrite existing records of, custom forms they cannot manage.", "datePublished": "2026-10-11T01:12:30", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T15:59:41", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/AnkesKasty/cve-request-poc/blob/a7b6d1423555812d8efa26c91c5d0683164b31e5/CordysCRM/poc_custom_form_data_import.py", "https://github.com/1Panel-dev/CordysCRM/blob/0d7ae06fe94f4ce33ec7f65b9d82a07ae05c2d94/backend/crm/src/main/java/cn/cordys/crm/form/controller/CustomFormDataController.java#L148-L154", "https://github.com/1Panel-dev/CordysCRM/blob/0d7ae06fe94f4ce33ec7f65b9d82a07ae05c2d94/backend/crm/src/main/java/cn/cordys/crm/form/service/CustomFormDataService.java#L874-L893", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/cordyscrm-through-1.9.3-missing-authorization-via-custom-form-data-import"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-108705", "GHSA-9hfx-wfh9-xc9r"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "c9f5fbae-6e9c-3188-ac65-36956258ccd5", "product": {"name": "CordysCRM", "vendor": {"name": "1Panel-dev"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.9.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "174675d4-b7bc-3ff7-9cde-8db18229f0e5", "vendor": {"name": "1Panel-dev"}}], "isExploited": false}